OL,3,GNEWSAScotland fans allowed to buy
OL,4,Aalcohol at upcoming games
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland fans will be able to buy
OL,7,Falcohol at upcoming games at Hampden
OL,8,FPark following a "good result" in
OL,9,Fearlier trials.
OL,11,FA ban is usually in place in Scottish
OL,12,Ffootball but trial alcohol sales have
OL,13,Fbeen taking place recently, including
OL,14,Ffor the national team's friendlies
OL,15,Fagainst Japan and Curacao earlier this
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThose fixtures saw alcohol served from
OL,19,Fpop-up hospitality bars in the stadium
OL,20,Fconcourse.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
