OL,3,GNEWSAScotland fans allowed to buy
OL,4,Aalcohol at upcoming games
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour occasional licences to cover two
OL,7,Fareas of the stadium concourse have now
OL,8,Fbeen approved for the games against
OL,9,FSwitzerland on 29 September and
OL,10,FSlovenia next month.
